  "sticky_notes": [
    {
      "id": "note_tracks_independent",
      "text": "**Tracks are independent.**\n\nThe **Drums** track (audio, below) and the **Visual** track (GPU, above) evolve on separate timelines. Launching a clip on one track doesn't touch the other.\n\nRight-click a track header in the session strip to rename, assign nodes, or remove.",
      "x": -20.0, "y": -280.0, "width": 380.0, "height": 110.0, "color": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "note_visual_track",
      "text": "**Visual track:** Shape2D → Render2D → Bloom\n\nThree clips, three identities:\n**Intro** — small blue circle, gentle glow\n**Verse** — orange pentagon, moderate bloom\n**Drop** — large red triangle, full-intensity bloom\n\nThe shape changes personality with each section.",
      "x": 430.0, "y": -280.0, "width": 360.0, "height": 120.0, "color": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note_scenes",
      "text": "**Scenes coordinate tracks.**\n\nA **Scene** groups one clip per track into a single launchable moment. Click ▶ on a scene row to fire all its assignments at once.\n\nOr click individual clip cells to swap one track independently — useful for building up or breaking down a mix.",
      "x": -20.0, "y": 550.0, "width": 380.0, "height": 120.0, "color": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "note_leave_unchanged",
      "text": "**Try mixing and matching:**\n\nLaunch the **Drop** drums clip manually, then launch the **Verse** visual scene — tracks are fully independent, so any combination is valid.\n\nRight-click an empty scene cell → **Clear from Scene** to leave that track unchanged when the scene fires.",
      "x": 430.0, "y": 550.0, "width": 360.0, "height": 120.0, "color": 4
    }
  ],
